---
interface Props {
  id?: string;
}
const { id = "seo-pricing" } = Astro.props;
---
<section id={id} class="py-24 px-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-darkest via-brand-dark to-brand-darkest relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <p class="text-brand-glow text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">✦ Transparent Pricing</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-4">SEO Services Pricing</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto">Transparent monthly SEO packages that mirror the same growth levels used on our website pricing page. Whether you already have a site or need ongoing optimization after a build, these tiers deliver the same technical depth, AI/GEO focus, and clear process.</p>
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-3">All work is fully transparent to the level you choose. With your permission we may also document the project as a public case study — nothing to hide. Builds credentials, trust, and our SEO pipeline at the same time.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Milestone Audits -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan/10 via-brand-blue/10 to-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-8">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-cyan/20 border border-brand-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan font-black shrink-0">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Milestone Audits — You're Never Locked In</h3>
            <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">Every monthly SEO plan is subject to a formal audit at each milestone (typically every 90 days, or sooner if major changes occur). We review the site's current performance, rankings, technical health, and AI visibility together. If the site has reached the point where no further meaningful optimizations are needed, we will tell you. You will not be stuck paying month after month for work that is no longer required.</p>
            <p class="text-white/70 leading-relaxed mt-3">At that point we can pause the plan, reduce the scope, or shift to a lighter maintenance level — whatever makes the most sense for your business. The goal is results, not endless retainers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-10">
      <!-- Foundation -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-dark via-brand-darkest to-[#050505] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15),_0_25px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),_0_0_30px_rgba(132,204,22,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">SEO Foundation</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Entry Level</p>
        <div class="mb-6 text-center">
          <span class="text-4xl md:text-[2.5rem] font-black font-nav bg-[linear-gradient(110deg,#f3db70,45%,#fff,55%,#9b7b2a)] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent">$297</span><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">/month</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4 italic">Entry-level ongoing optimization for simpler sites or businesses just getting started with search visibility.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70 mb-6 flex-1">
          <li>• Technical SEO maintenance (sitemap, robots.txt, basic crawlability)</li>
          <li>• Core on-page optimizations</li>
          <li>• Google Business Profile foundational setup & monitoring</li>
          <li>• Monthly performance snapshot</li>
          <li>• Priority support for critical issues</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-brand-cyan/80 text-xs font-semibold mb-4">Best for: Smaller brochure sites or businesses that need the essentials kept healthy.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="block w-full bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all duration-300 text-center">Get Free Quote Today!</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Growth SEO Engine -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#111111] via-brand-darkest to-brand-dark border border-[#f3db70]/50 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-[inset_0_2px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] hover:shadow-[inset_0_2px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2),_0_25px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7),_0_0_40px_rgba(243,219,112,0.25)] transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col scale-100 lg:scale-105 z-10">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#f3db70] text-[#0A0A0A] text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider drop-shadow-md whitespace-nowrap">Most Popular</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Growth SEO Engine</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Core AI Visibility Package</p>
        <div class="mb-6 text-center">
          <span class="text-4xl md:text-[2.5rem] font-black font-nav bg-[linear-gradient(110deg,#f3db70,45%,#fff,55%,#9b7b2a)] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent">$497</span><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">/month</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4 italic">The core all-in-one SEO + AI visibility package — matches the monthly level of our Growth Engine website plan.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70 mb-4 flex-1">
          <li>• Everything in Foundation, plus:</li>
          <li>• Full technical SEO overhauls & ongoing code-level improvements</li>
          <li>• Correct sitemap, robots.txt, and llms.txt maintenance for AI search (GEO)</li>
          <li>• Service-page optimization & internal linking</li>
          <li>• Local SEO (citations, GBP optimization, map-pack focus)</li>
          <li>• On-page keyword & content refinements</li>
          <li>• Core Web Vitals & speed monitoring</li>
          <li>• Monthly detailed reporting</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-brand-cyan/80 text-xs font-semibold mb-4">Best for: Most local service businesses that want consistent ranking growth and AI visibility.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="block w-full bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all duration-300 text-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)]">Get Free Quote Today!</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Authority -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-dark via-brand-darkest to-[#050505] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15),_0_25px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),_0_0_30px_rgba(132,204,22,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Authority SEO</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Content Authority Builder</p>
        <div class="mb-6 text-center">
          <span class="text-4xl md:text-[2.5rem] font-black font-nav bg-[linear-gradient(110deg,#f3db70,45%,#fff,55%,#9b7b2a)] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent">$679</span><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">/month</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4 italic">Matches the Authority Builder monthly level. Adds content systems that compound rankings over time.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70 mb-6 flex-1">
          <li>• Everything in Growth SEO Engine, plus:</li>
          <li>• Blog / resource content strategy & article implementation support</li>
          <li>• Deeper content optimization for search + AI engines</li>
          <li>• Expanded competitive research & topic clustering</li>
          <li>• Higher volume of monthly on-page & technical improvements</li>
          <li>• Advanced local + service-area page work</li>
          <li>• More comprehensive monthly reporting & strategy notes</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-brand-cyan/80 text-xs font-semibold mb-4">Best for: Businesses ready to publish regularly and build topical authority.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="block w-full bg-brand-accent text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all duration-300 text-center">Get Free Quote Today!</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Scale & Dominate -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-dark via-brand-darkest to-[#050505] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] hover:shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15),_0_25px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),_0_0_30px_rgba(132,204,22,0.15)] transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1">Scale & Dominate SEO</h3>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Aggressive Market Leader</p>
        <div class="mb-6 text-center">
          <span class="text-3xl md:text-[2rem] font-black font-nav bg-[linear-gradient(110deg,#f3db70,45%,#fff,55%,#9b7b2a)] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent">$998 – $1,998</span><span class="text-white/60 text-sm">/month</span>
          <p class="text-white/50 text-xs mt-1">or custom</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mb-4 italic">Matches the highest website tier. Full aggressive SEO + GEO program to dominate your market.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-white/70 mb-6 flex-1">
          <li>• Everything in Authority SEO, plus:</li>
          <li>• Advanced GEO / AI search visibility systems</li>
          <li>• Higher content volume & strategic link-building support</li>
          <li>• Multi-location or competitive market focus</li>
          <li>• Priority strategy sessions</li>
          <li>• Dedicated growth roadmap & higher-touch reporting</li>
          <li>• Custom technical & automation work as needed</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-xs mb-4">Custom quotes for enterprise sites, multi-location businesses, or complex environments.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="block w-full border-2 border-brand-purple text-brand-purple px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-purple hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 text-center">Free Custom Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-white/80 text-body-base md:text-body-lg max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed px-4">
      *** These monthly SEO pricing examples are not set in stone — they’re here for true transparency. Your project’s <span class="text-white font-bold">actual cost is determined by a custom quote</span> based on details and scope, and initial build costs vs. monthly SEO rates can be <span class="text-white font-bold">more or less interchangeable</span> depending on your unique online needs.
    </p>

    <!-- What's Always Included -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-8">
      <div class="bg-brand-darkest border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">What's Always Included Across All Paid SEO Plans</h3>
        <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-white/80">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-cyan">✓</span> Technical SEO & necessary code updates for full optimization</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-cyan">✓</span> Proper sitemap, robots.txt, and llms.txt maintenance (critical for AI visibility)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-cyan">✓</span> Service-page structure and ongoing improvements</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-cyan">✓</span> Speed, security, and Core Web Vitals care</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-cyan">✓</span> Transparent reporting so you always know exactly what is being done</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-cyan">✓</span> Milestone audits to confirm whether continued optimization is still needed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- How It Works / Payment -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-brand-darkest border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">How It Works With Website Builds</h3>
        <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-2"><strong class="text-white">Already have a site?</strong> Start on any SEO tier above.</p>
        <p class="text-white/80 text-sm">Building a new site with us? The monthly SEO work is already built into the <strong class="text-white">Growth Engine ($497)</strong>, <strong class="text-white">Authority Builder ($679)</strong>, and <strong class="text-white">Scale & Dominate ($998–$1,998)</strong> website packages on our main <a href="/pricing/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:text-white underline decoration-brand-cyan/30">pricing page</a> — no double-charging.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-brand-darkest border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Payment & Commitment</h3>
        <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mb-2">Monthly billing. Cancel anytime with 30 days notice after the initial commitment period (discussed during onboarding).</p>
        <p class="text-white/60 text-sm">Flexible options available. Milestone audits protect you from paying for unnecessary ongoing work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-white/80 mb-4">Not sure which SEO tier fits?</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/promotions/free-seo-audit/" class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light">Schedule Free SEO Audit / Consultation</a>
        <a href="tel:+17044738188" class="inline-block border border-white/20 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">Call/Text: (704) 473-8188</a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-xs mt-3">shelbywebco@gmail.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
